# --- Data ---
# The full CMS file (34 MB, 197,283 rows) is fetched by `make data` and never
# committed. A stratified sample under data/sample/ IS committed so the test
# suite and CI are hermetic and the demo cannot break on a dead download.
data/raw/
data/processed/
*.parquet
*.duckdb
*.duckdb.wal

